- **TASK 4 — prerenderer unit tests.** Done, relocated (deviation §2): `src/lib/seoRender.test.ts`, 19 tests — base-title replacement (one `<title>`), JSON-LD bytes equal `JSON.stringify(textContent)` and cannot terminate `<script>`, sitemap loc/lastmod format + escaping, robots content, `w3cDate`, noscript escaping, and the `resetPrerenderHead` idempotency contract.
